
PU17 processor.
(C) 1998 DJ Greaves, University of Cambridge, Computer Laboratory.



This directory contains the pu17 core verilog and wrapper verilog
to build a Xilinx version of the device.


Finally, in this directory, are bits of C code, including simsys.c,
that are needed to wrap a the pu17c.c C version generated by CBG VTOC.
 
There are a few bits of the PU16 processor left here, including the
emulator, but from now on we generate emulators automatically from the
Verilog using VTOC.

DJG
